WEBVTT

00:04.250 --> 00:06.960
I'm having Ragna face off with Ultimatia.

00:06.960 --> 00:07.670
Huh?

00:07.670 --> 00:08.460
What?

00:08.460 --> 00:13.080
Everyone needs cooperate
so we can kill the Winged Monarch.

00:13.880 --> 00:14.880
Yes, Master.

00:14.880 --> 00:16.330
No, no, no, no!

00:16.670 --> 00:19.710
I thought we were just
supposed to keep an eye on

00:19.710 --> 00:23.830
the Blood of the Wing's movements
as they destroy the country!

00:23.830 --> 00:26.210
I found something intriguing.

00:26.210 --> 00:28.080
Something named Ragna.

00:28.330 --> 00:31.210
The situation has changed
considerably because of him.

00:31.540 --> 00:34.540
We now have a great opportunity
to hunt the Winged Monarch.

00:34.540 --> 00:36.460
Didn't I tell you that?

00:36.460 --> 00:39.210
You told us about that
during our last meeting.

00:39.540 --> 00:40.670
But...

00:43.210 --> 00:47.040
Let me, your faithful servant,
give you counsel.

00:47.460 --> 00:50.630
We shouldn't challenge
the Winged Monarch now.

00:50.630 --> 00:51.540
Denied.

00:51.540 --> 00:52.670
What?

00:52.920 --> 00:54.880
Wait, please listen to me!

00:54.880 --> 00:57.380
Through the eyes of my
reconnaissance drone,

00:57.380 --> 01:01.380
I saw the very moment the Winged Monarch
took control of the capital.

01:01.670 --> 01:05.380
At that time, the Winged Monarch used...

01:07.500 --> 01:09.290
Time Control Magic.

01:09.290 --> 01:10.290
Isn't that something?

01:10.630 --> 01:14.210
Honestly, how can you top
something like that?

01:14.580 --> 01:16.040
Don't worry about it.

01:16.040 --> 01:18.540
Ragna will be the one doing
the fighting, not you.

01:18.540 --> 01:22.960
His pure combat capabilities are
higher than either of yours.

01:23.540 --> 01:26.040
Gee, that's a relief!

01:26.040 --> 01:27.960
I hate doing dirty work like fighting,

01:27.960 --> 01:31.960
so I'm totally on board with having
a colleague who's tough as nails!

01:32.380 --> 01:33.790
But...

01:33.790 --> 01:37.790
To tell you the truth,
after seeing Time Control Magic,

01:38.380 --> 01:40.750
I can't help but wonder
what meaning does strength hold

01:40.750 --> 01:42.880
when faced with the power to control time?

01:45.880 --> 01:47.880
Is something the matter?

01:47.880 --> 01:50.130
Are you feeling ill?

01:53.130 --> 01:54.880
Ultimatia! I spotted her.

01:54.880 --> 01:56.380
Hunt her! This a great chance!

01:56.380 --> 01:57.630
Wait. I have orders.

01:57.630 --> 01:59.130
Crimson isn't here.

01:59.130 --> 02:02.580
She's alone. I'd win a one-on-one fight.

02:02.580 --> 02:03.330
Really?

02:03.330 --> 02:04.330
I've hunted before!

02:04.330 --> 02:05.750
Don't fight her alone.

02:05.750 --> 02:07.830
Chimera. Golem.

02:08.420 --> 02:11.040
"Are you feeling ill?"

02:11.040 --> 02:12.420
What does that mean?
This feels weird.<b></b>

02:12.420 --> 02:13.790
I don't feel any hostility.
But I'm not the same as my future self.<b></b>

02:13.790 --> 02:15.080
I don't feel any hostility.
It's the same as the future.<b></b>

02:15.080 --> 02:15.920
It doesn't matter!

02:15.920 --> 02:19.000
Borgius. Nebulim. I'm hesitant.

02:19.000 --> 02:20.880
Don't fight when you feel hesitation.

02:20.880 --> 02:23.080
Fatal lapse in judgement.

02:23.080 --> 02:25.330
A child is with her.

02:25.330 --> 02:26.830
Who is that child?

02:27.290 --> 02:28.630
Why am I hesitating?

02:28.630 --> 02:29.710
Hurry.

02:29.710 --> 02:30.830
Kill her!

02:30.830 --> 02:31.790
Wait.

02:31.790 --> 02:33.000
Make up your mind!

04:04.330 --> 04:10.130
<b>Episode 6: Reunion</b>

04:07.130 --> 04:10.710
Lady Veronica, you don't need
to respond to him.

04:10.960 --> 04:14.330
He is simply overwhelmed by cowardice.

04:14.330 --> 04:15.170
What?

04:15.170 --> 04:18.710
I can carry out this task by myself.

04:18.710 --> 04:20.170
The hell you saying?

04:20.670 --> 04:24.920
You're just a bird-brained beastie
who's been housebroken.

04:25.130 --> 04:27.630
That's rich coming from an actual
clanking pile of junk.

04:27.630 --> 04:31.670
I'm always considering Lady Veronica's
needs and acting accordingly.

04:32.790 --> 04:34.670
What's twelve plus nine?

04:34.670 --> 04:35.790
Huh?

04:35.790 --> 04:37.540
Where did that come from?

04:37.540 --> 04:39.880
It's a simple question,
so just go ahead and answer.

04:39.880 --> 04:40.920
Excuse me.

04:40.920 --> 04:42.130
I can answer that question in a second.

04:42.130 --> 04:44.210
I don't think it's necessary
for me to answer.

04:44.210 --> 04:45.130
Hey.

04:45.130 --> 04:47.460
Which means you don't know the answer.

04:48.670 --> 04:50.500
Twelve plus nine...

04:50.500 --> 04:53.460
Human paws have five digits, so...

04:53.460 --> 04:55.580
Double that is ten...

04:55.580 --> 04:58.500
Oh, and if you add the ones
on their hind legs...

04:58.500 --> 04:59.790
Uh?

04:59.790 --> 05:03.210
You can't count it on your fingers.

05:03.210 --> 05:06.250
What's that? Can you not solve it, perhaps?

05:06.960 --> 05:08.880
How peculiar!

05:08.880 --> 05:11.460
But even children can solve
this easy-peasy math problem!

05:11.460 --> 05:12.580
Are you feeling okay?

05:13.000 --> 05:16.670
A featherbrain like you is anticipating
Lady Veronica's needs?

05:16.920 --> 05:19.330
Isn't what you're doing
the same as not thinking at a-

05:19.330 --> 05:20.500
Cut it out.

05:20.790 --> 05:23.540
You are artwork I crafted with
my knowledge and skills,

05:23.540 --> 05:27.420
though I used different approaches
to create each of you.

05:28.080 --> 05:33.040
You must grasp that insulting each other is
synonymous with spitting on I, your master.

05:33.040 --> 05:34.540
Yes, Master.

05:34.540 --> 05:35.960
This is your fault.

05:36.460 --> 05:38.130
What? It's yours!

05:38.130 --> 05:39.500
No, it's yours!

05:39.500 --> 05:41.380
Knock if off, you dunces!

05:42.420 --> 05:44.330
Back to the topic at hand.

05:44.330 --> 05:46.040
What were we discussing again?

05:46.330 --> 05:47.750
This.

05:47.750 --> 05:48.580
Hm?

05:54.460 --> 05:55.790
Ah, that's right.

05:56.170 --> 06:00.250
What meaning does strength hold
when faced with the power to control time?

06:02.080 --> 06:03.790
Golem, please...

06:03.790 --> 06:04.920
self-destruct.

06:05.330 --> 06:06.290
Why?

06:06.920 --> 06:10.130
In essence, aren't you implying that

06:10.130 --> 06:14.330
I'm a dimwit who's
so obsessed with my new toy

06:14.330 --> 06:18.000
that I'm making a gamble
I don't have a chance of winning.

06:18.000 --> 06:19.790
I'm really in trouble now!

06:19.790 --> 06:21.880
No, absolutely not, Master!

06:21.880 --> 06:24.420
It would be inconvenient
if you self-destructed now.

06:24.790 --> 06:26.040
That's it!

06:26.040 --> 06:29.380
How about you wait for an opportune moment
during the battle to blow yourself up?

06:29.380 --> 06:31.170
Please have mercy on me!

06:31.630 --> 06:33.040
Damn it!

06:33.040 --> 06:35.710
That varmint's face is pissing me off!

06:41.040 --> 06:43.540
Time Control Magic isn't invincible.

06:43.540 --> 06:47.380
This footage is already proof of that.

06:59.290 --> 07:01.250
You've gotta be kidding me.

07:02.210 --> 07:05.210
That airhead got hunted by these yahoos?

07:06.790 --> 07:08.420
Oh, I understand now.

07:08.420 --> 07:09.790
This guy is...

07:09.790 --> 07:12.130
Far above the Tempest Cell!

07:12.750 --> 07:16.500
It's written all over your faces.
You know it's time to die.

07:17.500 --> 07:19.380
That'll make our chat easy.

07:20.750 --> 07:26.040
Cough up everything you know about the guy
that gave you those silver swords!

07:26.330 --> 07:28.880
You're free to refuse.

07:29.210 --> 07:31.080
If you dare!

07:34.210 --> 07:35.500
Er...

07:35.500 --> 07:36.790
Lady,

07:36.790 --> 07:38.790
I'd keep your dishtanshe from this dude.

07:38.790 --> 07:40.790
He might actshually barf on you.

07:40.790 --> 07:43.170
He'sh shick from jusht being in a crowd.

07:43.170 --> 07:44.880
He'sh a real pushover!

07:44.880 --> 07:47.460
O-oh, I see.

07:47.460 --> 07:50.000
I'm sorry I didn't realize.

07:50.000 --> 07:52.710
We all make mishtakesh!

07:52.710 --> 07:54.330
I ashept your apology!

07:55.790 --> 07:57.040
Yeah.

07:57.670 --> 07:59.790
Yeah, that's right.

07:59.790 --> 08:01.380
Don't worry about me.

08:01.380 --> 08:03.000
We're nishe guysh like that.

08:03.210 --> 08:04.790
I've decided.

08:04.790 --> 08:06.630
I won't fight her now.

08:06.920 --> 08:09.920
I'll meet up with Crimson,
and I'll hunt her again!

08:10.420 --> 08:12.460
I apologize for jumping to conclusions.

08:12.460 --> 08:14.920
But please take care.

08:14.920 --> 08:16.630
That's for the best.

08:16.630 --> 08:18.540
That's the correct decision.

08:19.080 --> 08:21.710
I almost jumped the gun
when I was alone.

08:22.080 --> 08:24.040
Thank you, Mister Sli-

08:25.040 --> 08:26.670
By the way, lady.

08:27.420 --> 08:31.080
For a shtupid human, you shmell nishe
and look shcrumptioush!

08:31.080 --> 08:32.710
A stupid human?

08:32.710 --> 08:33.880
Scrumptious?

08:34.250 --> 08:35.420
Boing!

08:35.420 --> 08:36.710
Purururururu!

08:39.500 --> 08:41.920
Lemme have a jusht a tiny tashte!

08:41.920 --> 08:43.500
Lemme lick your fashe!

08:44.040 --> 08:45.210
Puru!

08:45.210 --> 08:48.710
Lady, let's hurry up and
look for my parents.

08:48.710 --> 08:50.750
Ah, yes. That's right.

08:50.750 --> 08:51.580
Puru?

08:52.170 --> 08:54.170
Ish he losht?

08:54.170 --> 08:57.880
Yes. We're looking for
his parents together.

09:04.040 --> 09:06.420
Wh-why?

09:06.420 --> 09:07.500
Stop!

09:07.500 --> 09:10.710
Why are you being so nice to this child?

09:10.710 --> 09:12.750
Don't ask any unnecessary questions.

09:12.750 --> 09:17.710
Uh... Do I need a reason
to be nice to someone?

09:23.080 --> 09:24.630
Let's go, Mister Slime.

09:24.630 --> 09:25.670
Huh?

09:25.670 --> 09:26.630
Urgh.

09:26.630 --> 09:27.920
Please wait a moment.

09:29.710 --> 09:32.080
Have we met somewhere before-

09:32.080 --> 09:33.080
No.

09:34.750 --> 09:36.330
Lady Ultimatia!

09:36.630 --> 09:38.170
Nebulim!

09:38.580 --> 09:40.040
Lady Ultimatia!

09:41.670 --> 09:43.080
I'm so relieved.

09:43.750 --> 09:45.750
I finally found you.

09:46.080 --> 09:49.290
However, the Elder found out, unfortunately.

09:49.290 --> 09:51.920
Er, he's livid.

09:51.920 --> 09:53.170
Oh, dear.

09:53.170 --> 09:55.420
I'm sorry for the trouble I caused you.

09:55.420 --> 09:56.710
It was none at all.

09:56.710 --> 09:58.500
More importantly...

09:58.500 --> 10:00.210
who is that?

10:00.710 --> 10:02.630
He looks like a dragon hunter.

10:03.670 --> 10:07.210
I was the one who struck up
a conversation with him.

10:07.210 --> 10:09.420
The crowd made him sick.

10:09.790 --> 10:11.630
The crowd made him sick...

10:12.630 --> 10:15.080
That does happen to some people, doesn't it?

10:15.080 --> 10:18.500
No wonder I've been feeling ba-

10:19.500 --> 10:21.080
Nebulim?!

10:21.920 --> 10:23.710
I'm sorry...

10:24.710 --> 10:27.500
All these people are making me feel sick.

10:27.500 --> 10:29.040
You too?

10:29.460 --> 10:31.170
What should we do?

10:31.170 --> 10:33.630
Maybe we can find a place
that's not crowded...

10:35.500 --> 10:36.670
Huh?

10:39.000 --> 10:41.500
Why is the Winged Monarch
visible in the footage?

10:41.500 --> 10:42.500
Huh?

10:42.960 --> 10:45.040
The reason the Winged Monarch
suddenly appears

10:45.040 --> 10:47.380
and the room completely changes

10:47.380 --> 10:49.790
is because time had been
stopped until then.

10:51.080 --> 10:54.500
But why did she choose that moment
to restart the flow of time?

10:55.330 --> 10:57.000
Maybe she was out of magic.

10:57.710 --> 11:02.380
Or maybe there is limit on
how long she can pause time?

11:02.920 --> 11:07.040
Or is it because she rewound time?

11:07.040 --> 11:08.330
Correct.

11:08.830 --> 11:10.880
The reason we can see her in the footage

11:10.880 --> 11:14.790
is because she rewound only the injuries
that caused King Lese's death.

11:15.250 --> 11:18.290
Chimera. You're no mathematician,

11:18.290 --> 11:22.250
but you excel at assessing situations
and putting your intuition to good use.

11:23.500 --> 11:25.210
I'm not worthy of this praise.

11:25.210 --> 11:26.210
Hmph!

11:27.080 --> 11:30.380
She cannot pause and
rewind time simultaneously.

11:30.380 --> 11:34.210
For her to rewind time,
she must unpause time.

11:34.210 --> 11:37.080
As long as she is rewinding time,
she can't pause it.

11:37.750 --> 11:40.210
This is Time Control Magic's weakness.

11:40.750 --> 11:42.750
Let's suppose...

11:42.750 --> 11:45.500
We ambush and kill Ultimatia.

11:45.500 --> 11:48.500
If we did, she'd automatically
use her Time Control Magic

11:48.500 --> 11:52.330
and rewind time on her body
to an alive state.

11:52.540 --> 11:56.380
But as long as she's rewinding time,
she can't pause time.

11:56.830 --> 12:00.750
Before she's done rewinding time
on her body, we'll kill her again.

12:00.750 --> 12:03.500
Her Time Control Magic is
triggered again and rewinds.

12:03.500 --> 12:05.210
We'll kill her again.

12:05.210 --> 12:06.540
She'll rewind again.

12:06.540 --> 12:07.750
Kill.

12:07.750 --> 12:09.290
Rewind.

12:09.960 --> 12:12.420
What will happen if this keeps repeating?

12:12.420 --> 12:16.830
Well, even the First Seat will eventually
burn through all her magic.

12:16.830 --> 12:18.080
And die.

12:18.330 --> 12:20.790
She won't be able to rewind.

12:21.630 --> 12:25.540
Naturally, I anticipate she'll
counterattack with methods

12:25.540 --> 12:27.880
that use her colossal magic stores.

12:29.500 --> 12:36.000
But I expect Ragna will fend off
her counterattacks and manage to kill her.

12:36.500 --> 12:38.040
In fact...

12:38.040 --> 12:40.630
That's why we need to start hunting
all the dragons in the land now.

12:40.630 --> 12:44.080
But mostly importantly, we need to hunt down
the Winged Monarch that leads them.

12:44.080 --> 12:46.040
You're kidding, right?

12:46.040 --> 12:47.790
Our future selves pulled it off.

12:49.630 --> 12:53.540
If it's true that we kill the Winged Monarch
in the future like Ragna said,

12:53.540 --> 12:55.830
this is the method he must have
used to kill her.

12:56.170 --> 12:59.210
Time Control Magic has a number
of limitations and weak points.

12:59.500 --> 13:03.420
Its only directly lethal aspect is the inability
to use different powers simultaneously.

13:04.000 --> 13:07.540
This is currently the only viable
method of killing her.

13:08.130 --> 13:09.380
In other words...

13:10.040 --> 13:13.130
Ragna can beat her in
a one-on-one confrontation.

13:13.580 --> 13:16.630
The problem is Nebulim and Borgius.

13:16.630 --> 13:20.330
We cannot allow them to help
the Winged Monarch.

13:20.750 --> 13:24.040
Now you understand the gravity
of your roles, I presume.

13:24.040 --> 13:25.880
Be circumspect as you fulfill your mission.

13:25.880 --> 13:27.080
Yes, Master!

13:30.170 --> 13:32.710
What'sh gotten into you all of a shudden?

13:33.750 --> 13:34.460
Did I make the right decision?

13:34.460 --> 13:36.040
Hey, are you lishtening to me?
Did I make the right decision?<b></b>

13:36.040 --> 13:36.960
Hey, are you lishtening to me?

13:36.960 --> 13:38.500
I must have.

13:38.500 --> 13:41.080
My future self wouldn't have
hesitated to fight her.

13:41.630 --> 13:47.080
But his lack of hesitation certainly
didn't always result in good outcomes.

13:48.130 --> 13:51.170
I'm not the same as my future self
who led a life of loss.

13:51.170 --> 13:53.580
I haven't lost anyone yet.

13:53.580 --> 13:55.080
Oh? Ignoring me?

13:55.080 --> 13:56.790
You've got shome ballsh!
Compared to my future self,<b></b>

13:57.420 --> 13:59.540
I'm not as enraged.

14:00.750 --> 14:03.630
Yes, that's right, Ragna.

14:05.040 --> 14:07.750
You don't need rage.

14:07.750 --> 14:10.960
Stay calm and obey my orders.

14:11.290 --> 14:15.710
That is crucial in order for us
to annihilate dragonkind.

14:16.920 --> 14:19.380
I acted calmly.

14:20.210 --> 14:22.920
Retreating was the right decision.

14:22.920 --> 14:24.380
But even so...

14:25.380 --> 14:29.080
What is this awful feeling inside me?

14:29.580 --> 14:31.170
Puru, puru!

14:33.750 --> 14:37.080
Hey, how do you like them applesh?
Doesh it hurt?

14:37.460 --> 14:38.710
Mister Slime...

14:38.710 --> 14:39.960
Puru?

14:39.960 --> 14:42.420
Is there a way for us to contact Crimson?

14:42.750 --> 14:44.460
Of courshe!

14:47.080 --> 14:51.000
With thish devishe,
I can talk to Mashter Crinonica!

14:52.130 --> 14:53.960
Then tell him something for me.

14:54.670 --> 14:56.790
Tell him: "I found the target."

15:03.880 --> 15:04.960
Pu?

15:06.750 --> 15:10.080
He jusht wandered off on hish own!

15:12.290 --> 15:13.830
For crying out loud.

15:13.830 --> 15:16.250
Raising morale is a pain in the ass.

15:16.580 --> 15:19.960
They're prepared to give up
their lives for my sake.

15:19.960 --> 15:23.210
It's no surprise they don't trust Ragna.

15:23.750 --> 15:28.630
A new human with no loyalty
is playing an essential role.

15:28.630 --> 15:30.460
That cannot be gratifying for them.

15:31.250 --> 15:33.630
But that's just for now.

15:34.750 --> 15:37.960
If you feel yourself wavering,
think of me first and foremost.

15:37.960 --> 15:40.080
Remember my orders.

15:40.380 --> 15:43.130
Stay calm. Stay calm.

15:43.130 --> 15:47.630
I've been giving Ragna subliminal
messages since the day we met.

15:47.630 --> 15:53.210
Someday when I give him the order,
he'll mercilessly kill whoever I want.

15:53.210 --> 15:57.750
After all, he's merely an ordinary man who
happens to have power out of his league.

15:57.750 --> 16:00.170
Making him my puppet will be
a piece of cake.

16:01.710 --> 16:04.500
Now, let's devise a concrete plan.

16:04.500 --> 16:05.710
Yes, Master!

16:05.710 --> 16:08.790
Hello? Hellooo?

16:09.290 --> 16:10.830
Mashter Crinonica?

16:10.830 --> 16:12.080
It'sh me!

16:12.080 --> 16:14.710
Your mosht loyal shervant, Shlime!

16:14.710 --> 16:15.750
Over!

16:16.210 --> 16:17.630
What's this about?

16:17.750 --> 16:20.000
<b>Master Crinonica's Orders</b>

16:18.420 --> 16:19.670
Um...

16:20.000 --> 16:22.000
<b>Master Crinonica's Orders</b>

16:20.000 --> 16:22.000
<b>Stay somewhere secluded</b>

16:20.210 --> 16:21.210
Ah...

16:22.000 --> 16:24.000
<b>Master Crinonica's Orders</b>

16:22.000 --> 16:24.000
<b>Don't move or talk to others</b>

16:22.250 --> 16:23.250
Er...

16:24.000 --> 16:25.040
Uh...

16:24.000 --> 16:28.750
<b>Master Crinonica's Orders</b>

16:24.000 --> 16:28.750
<b>Watch the shtupid human</b>

16:28.500 --> 16:29.670
Pururu!

16:28.750 --> 16:29.670
<b>The shtupid human went off shomewhere on hish own!!</b>

16:29.670 --> 16:32.000
That shtupid human betrayed ush!

16:32.420 --> 16:33.500
What?

16:40.290 --> 16:42.630
Thank you, Nebulim.

16:43.130 --> 16:47.500
Despite not feeling well,
you indulged my whims.

16:47.790 --> 16:49.830
I-it was no t-t-trouble!

16:50.000 --> 16:56.540
I-it's a privilege to assist in one of your
acts of kindness, Lady Ultimatia.

16:57.960 --> 17:00.580
I'm not kind.

17:00.960 --> 17:03.040
Lady Ultimatia, you are kind!

17:03.460 --> 17:06.630
You saved me, so you can
believe me when I say-

17:10.460 --> 17:13.170
I-I'm s-s-sorry...

17:13.170 --> 17:16.040
I've disgraced myself not once, but twice...

17:18.210 --> 17:20.420
Thank you, Nebulim.

17:22.170 --> 17:28.330
At least you think my actions
aren't self-gratifying.

17:28.710 --> 17:30.540
Y-yes.

17:33.670 --> 17:35.170
By the way...

17:35.170 --> 17:39.040
Is that family included on today's list?

17:39.750 --> 17:40.920
Yes.

17:40.920 --> 17:43.170
All three are scheduled to disappear today.

17:43.170 --> 17:45.130
Oh, thank goodness!

17:46.380 --> 17:48.920
Ah, I get it now.

17:50.330 --> 17:54.830
I-I can make people within the barrier
vanish without any pain whatsoever.

17:54.830 --> 17:58.000
It's as if they were never there
in the first place.

17:58.830 --> 18:04.170
And as long as they're in the barrier,
no one will realize they've disappeared.

18:05.290 --> 18:07.960
It's impossible to escape death.

18:07.960 --> 18:12.080
But pain and fear can be escaped.

18:12.670 --> 18:18.830
Happy people can remain happy
as they're obliterated.

18:18.830 --> 18:20.960
I believe that's salvation.

18:25.580 --> 18:29.830
Displaying those dragon corpses
was very effective.

18:31.170 --> 18:34.830
By doing the same throughout
the capital from now on,

18:34.830 --> 18:37.960
we can give the people peace of mind.

18:46.250 --> 18:48.080
I want to a redo.

18:49.000 --> 18:51.580
It's you from earlier.

18:51.960 --> 18:53.790
What's wrong?

18:53.790 --> 18:56.380
I figured out what was making me sick.

18:56.380 --> 18:57.580
Huh?

18:57.790 --> 18:59.040
I...

18:59.500 --> 19:02.290
wasn't avoiding a fight by remaining calm.

19:03.130 --> 19:04.750
I was afraid.

19:05.250 --> 19:08.130
Afraid of your ever cryptic nature.

19:08.130 --> 19:09.920
Afraid of myself and not being able to

19:09.920 --> 19:12.170
competently use the power
that was entrusted to me.

19:12.170 --> 19:15.040
It wasn't about whether or not
my decision was right.

19:15.040 --> 19:19.330
I was deceiving myself and pretending
to be cool-headed by withdrawing.

19:20.000 --> 19:22.210
That's why I felt sick.

19:23.290 --> 19:24.880
All that rage.

19:25.630 --> 19:27.880
All that self-proclaimed resolve.

19:28.880 --> 19:31.170
I'm ashamed of myself!

19:33.920 --> 19:35.420
I'm sorry.

19:35.420 --> 19:39.040
I don't understand a single thing
you're talking about.

19:40.830 --> 19:42.080
Nebulim?

19:43.630 --> 19:45.330
I'm sorry, Crimson.

19:45.790 --> 19:51.080
I'm sure you're gleefully concocting
a plan to hunt Ultimatia right now.

19:52.210 --> 19:55.210
Now, I'm about to waste all your efforts.

19:58.630 --> 20:00.830
If I don't challenge you right now...

20:01.460 --> 20:04.460
My oath and resolve to slay all dragons...

20:05.130 --> 20:07.210
will mean nothing!

20:09.210 --> 20:10.630
I see now.

20:10.630 --> 20:13.630
You're our enemy.

20:16.750 --> 20:18.290
Heed me...

20:19.580 --> 20:21.540
all creation and fall sti-

20:25.500 --> 20:27.000
Heed me, time...

20:30.170 --> 20:31.580
and return.

20:33.710 --> 20:36.540
Heed me, creation...

20:37.380 --> 20:38.460
and fall sti-

20:46.130 --> 20:47.710
Wh-what was that?

20:48.080 --> 20:49.290
A arm!

20:53.080 --> 20:55.000
Initiating rewind.

20:55.580 --> 20:58.420
2.88 seconds until completion.

21:01.500 --> 21:07.250
Considerable cognitive decline
due to lack of brain matter.

21:07.630 --> 21:10.460
Unable to express feelings of anguish.

21:10.460 --> 21:13.670
Grief. Grief. So much grief.

21:14.920 --> 21:16.420
I will counterattack.

21:16.880 --> 21:19.580
Objective is to crush him to death.

21:25.710 --> 21:26.880
Death.

21:26.880 --> 21:28.040
Third surprise.

21:28.040 --> 21:31.330
In the sky over the city?

21:31.330 --> 21:32.630
What happ-

21:37.040 --> 21:38.790
Rewind time however many times you like.

21:39.330 --> 21:42.210
Blood is flame.

21:42.960 --> 21:44.210
Silverine Sword.

21:56.080 --> 21:57.130
Evade.

21:57.130 --> 21:59.380
No. No. Impossible.

22:00.170 --> 22:02.000
Die, Winged Monarch.

22:02.710 --> 22:06.250
The greatest kindness you can do for people...

22:07.420 --> 22:09.170
is to die here.
